title: "The UFO — Governed Deformable Radial Membrane"
abstract: >
  A governed, compute-aware AI personalization architecture that models behavior
  as a deformable radial membrane. This repository contains the governed
  simulation implementation, operator stack, mathematical definitions, and
  validation traces referenced in the DOI-linked research artifact.
